    {
      "id": "1e311c32a7bc-q1",
      "number": 1,
      "question": "If 44 - 12 = 30, 77 - 14 = 61, 84 - 16 = 66 then what should be for 44 - 22 = ?",
      "questionHtml": "If 44 - 12 = 30, 77 - 14 = 61, 84 - 16 = 66 then what should be for 44 - 22 = ?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "28",
          "html": "28"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "20",
          "html": "20"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "32",
          "html": "32"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "24",
          "html": "24"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p>44 - (12 + 2) = 44 - 14 = 30,</p>\n\n<p>77 - (14 + 2) = 77 - 16 = 61,</p>\n\n<p>84 - (16 + 2) = 84 - 18 = 66</p>\n\n<p>Same as,</p>\n\n<p>44 - (22 + 2) = 44 - 24 = 20</p>\nHence, 20 is the correct answer.",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "1e311c32a7bc-q2",
      "number": 2,
      "question": "If 4 @ 3 @ 9 = 16 and 2 @ 4 @ 6 = 12, then 4 @ 1 @ 3 = ?",
      "questionHtml": "If 4 @ 3 @ 9 = 16 and 2 @ 4 @ 6 = 12, then 4 @ 1 @ 3 = ?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "11",
          "html": "11"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "6",
          "html": "6"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "8",
          "html": "8"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "9",
          "html": "9"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p>4 @ 3 @ 9 = 16 can be written as</p>\n\n<p>4 + 3 + 9 = 16</p>\n\n<p>2 @ 4 @ 6 = 12 can be written as</p>\n\n<p>2 + 4 + 6 = 12</p>\n\n<p>Similarly, 4 @ 1 @ 3 can be written as</p>\n\n<p>4 + 1 + 3 = 8</p>\n\n<p>Thus, 8 is the correct answer.</p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "1e311c32a7bc-q3",
      "number": 3,
      "question": "If - 4 $ 1 = 4, 7 $ - 7 = 49 and 3 $ 1 = - 3 than find the value of - 8 $ - 5 ?",
      "questionHtml": "If - 4 $ 1 = 4, 7&nbsp;$ &nbsp;- 7 = 49 and 3 $ 1 = - 3 than find the value of - 8 $ - 5 ?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "-1",
          "html": "-1"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "92",
          "html": "92"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "-40",
          "html": "-40"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "-69",
          "html": "-69"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p><u><strong>Logic:</strong></u></p>\n\n<p>$ represents &times;, and if the answer is positive it is to be changed to negative and vice - versa.</p>\n\n<p><strong>In&nbsp;- 4 $ 1 = 4&nbsp;&rarr;</strong></p>\n\n<p>-4 $ 1 &nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>= -4 &times; 1 &times; -1</p>\n\n<p>= 4</p>\n\n<p><strong>In&nbsp;7&nbsp;$&nbsp;&nbsp;- 7 = 49&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">&rarr;</span></strong></p>\n\n<p>7 $ - 7</p>\n\n<p>= 7 &times; -7 &times; -1</p>\n\n<p>= 49</p>\n\n<p><strong>In&nbsp;3&nbsp;$&nbsp;1 = - 3&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">&rarr;</span></strong></p>\n\n<p>3 $ 1</p>\n\n<p>= 3 &times; 1 &times;&nbsp;- 1</p>\n\n<p>= - 3</p>\n\n<p>Similarly,</p>\n\n<p><strong>In&nbsp;- 8 $ - 5&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">&rarr;</span></strong></p>\n\n<p>-8 $ - 5</p>\n\n<p>= - 8 &times; - 5 &times;&nbsp;- 1</p>\n\n<p>= -&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">40</span></p>\nHence, &quot;<strong>- 40&quot;</strong> is the correct answer.",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "1e311c32a7bc-q4",
      "number": 4,
      "question": "If 4 @ 9 # 3 = &ndash; 2 and 11 # 2 @ 6 = 7, then 14 @ 3 # 7 = ?",
      "questionHtml": "If 4 @ 9 # 3 = &ndash; 2 and 11 # 2 @ 6 = 7, then 14 @ 3 # 7 = ?&nbsp;",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "16",
          "html": "16"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "18",
          "html": "18"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "4",
          "html": "4"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "10",
          "html": "10"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p>The explanation is as follows,</p>\n\n<p>Here @ and # is used as a code for &ndash; and + respectively. i.e.</p>\n\n<p>4 @ 9 # 3 = &ndash; 2 &rarr; 4 &ndash; 9 + 3 = &ndash; 5 + 3 = &ndash; 2.</p>\n\n<p>11 # 2 @ 6 = 7 &rarr; 11 + 2 &ndash; 6 = 13 &ndash; 6 = 7.</p>\n\n<p>Similarly,</p>\n\n<p>14 @ 3 # 7 = ? &rarr; 14 &ndash; 3 + 7 = 11 + 7 = 18.</p>\n\n<p>Hence, 18 is the correct alternative.</p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "1e311c32a7bc-q5",
      "number": 5,
      "question": "If 66 @ 17 @ 53 = 641551 and 17 @ 9 @ 99 = 15797, then 41 @ 11 @ 81 = ?",
      "questionHtml": "If 66 @ 17 @ 53 = 641551 and 17 @ 9 @ 99 = 15797, then 41 @ 11 @ 81 = ?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "79993",
          "html": "79993"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "37999",
          "html": "37999"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "39979",
          "html": "39979"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "39997",
          "html": "39997"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p>The logic followed here is as follows:</p>\n\n<p>66 @ 17 @ 53 = (66 - 2) (17 - 2) (53 - 2) = <u>64</u> <u>15</u> <u>51</u></p>\n\n<p>17 @ 9 @ 99 = (17 - 2) (9 - 2) (99 - 2) = <u>15</u> <u>7</u> <u>97</u></p>\n\n<p>41 @ 11 @ 81 = (41 - 2) (11 - 2) (81 - 2) = <u>39</u> <u>9</u> <u>79</u></p>\nHence, <strong>39979</strong> is the correct answer.",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
