      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p>The logic followed here is:</p>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"158\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"width:158px;height:17px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">Letter</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:79px;height:17px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">Z</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:79px;height:17px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">X</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"width:158px;height:17px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">Meaning</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:79px;height:17px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">-</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:79px;height:17px;\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-left:.25in;\">+</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>121 X 56 Z 89 = 88 &rarr; 121 + 56 - 89 = 88;</p>\n\n<p>754 Z 612 X 111 = 253 &rarr; 754 - 612 + 111 = 253;</p>\n\n<p>Similarly,</p>\n\n<p>1304 Z 657 X 10 = ? &rarr; 1304 - 657 + 10 = 657</p>\nHence, the answer is &lsquo;657&rsquo;.",
