    {
      "id": "1e311c32a7bc-q7",
      "number": 7,
      "question": "If 14 # 3 @ 4 = 46 and 19 # 4 @ 3 = 79, then 21 # 4 @ 1 = ?",
      "questionHtml": "If 14 # 3 @ 4 = 46 and 19 # 4 @ 3 = 79, then 21 # 4 @ 1 = ?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "25",
          "html": "25"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "92",
          "html": "92"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "85",
          "html": "85"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "97",
          "html": "97"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p>Here, # represents multiplication (&times;) and @ represents addition (+).</p>\n\n<p>14 # 3 @ 4 = 14 &times; 3 + 4 = 42 + 4 = 46</p>\n\n<p>19 # 4 @ 3 = 19 &times; 4 + 3 = 76 + 3 = 79</p>\n\n<p>Similarly,</p>\n\n<p>21 # 4 @ 1 = 21 &times; 4 + 1 = 84 + 1 = 85</p>\nHence, the correct answer for the given equation would be 85.",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "1e311c32a7bc-q8",
      "number": 8,
      "question": "If 26#14 = 80; 5#3 = 16; 6#5 = 22; then what is the value of 14#5 = ?",
      "questionHtml": "<p>If 26#14 = 80; 5#3 = 16; 6#5 = 22; then what is the value of 14#5 = ?</p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "17",
          "html": "17"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "38",
          "html": "38"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "4",
          "html": "4"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "9",
          "html": "9"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p>The pattern followed is that both the numbers are added, and result is multiplied by 2,</p>\n\n<p>26#14 = 80</p>\n\n<p>&rarr; (26 + 14) &times; 2 = 80</p>\n\n<p>5#3 = 16</p>\n\n<p>&rarr; (5 + 3) &times; 2 = 16</p>\n\n<p>6#5 = 22</p>\n\n<p>&rarr; (6 + 5) &times; 2 = 22</p>\n\n<p>Similarly;</p>\n\n<p>(14 + 5) &times; 2 = 38</p>\n\n<p>Hence, correct answer is 38.</p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "1e311c32a7bc-q9",
      "number": 9,
      "question": "Find out the correct answer for the unsolved equation based on a certain system. If 16 % 25 % 8 = 40; 9 % 81 % 27 = 81 then 121 % 36 % 216 = ?",
      "questionHtml": "<p>Find out the correct answer for the unsolved equation based on a certain system.</p>\n\n<p>If 16 % 25 % 8 = 40; 9 % 81 % 27&nbsp; = 81 then 121 % 36 % 216 = ?&nbsp;</p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "693",
          "html": "693"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "936",
          "html": "936"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "396",
          "html": "396"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "963",
          "html": "963"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p>The pattern is:</p>\n\n<p>16 % 25 % 8 = 40 &rarr; (16)<sup>1/2</sup> &times; (25)<sup>1/2</sup> &times; (8)<sup>1/3</sup> = 4 &times; 5 &times; 2 = 40</p>\n\n<p>9 % 81 % 27 = 81 &rarr; (9)<sup>1/2</sup>&nbsp;&times; (81)<sup>1/2</sup>&times; (27)<sup>1/3</sup>&nbsp;= 3 &times; 9 &times; 3 = 81</p>\n\n<p>Similarly,</p>\n\n<p>121 % 36 % 216 = ? &rarr; (121)<sup>1/2</sup> &times; (36)<sup>1/2</sup> &times; (216)<sup>1/3</sup> = 11 &times; 6 &times; 6 = 396</p>\nHence, the correct answer is &rsquo;396&rsquo;.",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
