      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">14 C 7 = 245 → 14<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span> + 7<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span> = 245 → 196 + 49 = 245</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">17 C 8 = 353 → 17<span style=\"position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span> + 8<span style=\"position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span> = 353 → 289 + 64 = 353</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">15 C 4 = ? </span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">→ 15</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> + 4</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> = ? </span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">→ 225 + 16 = ? </span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">→ 241 = ?</span></p>\n",
